window.products.push({"id":968183,"name":"19pcs Cocktail Shaker Set Bartender Kit, 24oz Cocktail Shaker Drink Mixer Rose Gold Stainless Steel Bar Set with Muddler for Cocktails, Cocktail Picks","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7141UawXgsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🥂[19pcs Bar Cocktail Shaker Set]🍻---This professional cocktail set contains one 24 OZ stainless steel cocktail shaker, 1 cocktail stirrer mixing spoon, 1 cocktail strainer, 4 cocktail picks, 4*liquor pourers, 4 stainless ice cubes, 1*cocktail muddler and jigger for measuring, 1* ice tong, 1*corkscrew, and 1 manual of recipes. You’ll get a cocktail kit as both professional bartender kit and home cocktail shaker set. 🍸[Stainless Steel Cocktail Bar Set]🍷---This rose gold bar cocktail set is made of high-upgraded thick solid 18/8 stainless steel, restless, food grade and dishwasher safe. With great manufacturing technology and solid steel materials, the glossy rose gold copper cocktail shaker tools won’t get dull after times of washing. 🥂[Large Cocktail Shaker Leakproof]🍾--- The rose gold martini shaker is with large capacity of 24oz, can contain lots of mixers in one time, with tight closure, the cobbler shaker is leak proof however you shake it. The thick stain steel makes it a sturdy and durable bar drink shaker or home entertaining drink shaker. 🍸[Versatile Bartender Kit]🍹---With variety of basic bar accessories, this barware tool set is ideal professional bar tools bartender tool kit, the bartender can create various of wonderful drinks or liquors, cocktails like Martini, Mojito, Whiskey, Margaritas, etc. It’s also perfect home cocktail shaker set for cocktail party, making your own cocktails, soda drinks, fizzy alcoholic drinks for your guests just at home. You can be a home bartender with these basic necessary bar tools! 💝[GREAT GIFT IDEA---Party Gift]🍻----Gift box packaged with cocktail shaker, drink mixer spoon, muddler, strainer, jigger, cocktail skewers, ice cubes, tong, corkscrew and cocktail recipes booklet, this pro bartender cocktail kit is great gift for someone who is fond of mixing drinks. Nice birthday, holiday or cocktail party gift for your family, friends and enjoy bar-caliber drinks in every fun parties.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7141UawXgsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PHUNTTEK","source_asin":"B0B1PNWLQP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-968183","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B1PNWLQP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B1PNWLQP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
