window.products.push({"id":968461,"name":"Automatic Foam Soap Dispenser - Motion Sensor - Soap Dispenser Automatic - Touchless Hand soap Dispenser - Battery Operated - White Foam soap Pump for","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51BjfKuDUFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"FEATURES 100% touch-free just place your hand under the spout and it dispenses soap automatically.An upgraded sensor that extends its life and sensitivity, so you can get the soap dispensing quickly.Our sturdy dispenser, helps you ensure no germs or viruses are left behind.Perfect for any bathroom or kitchen sink countertop bathroom, office, school, kindergarten, clinics, hotels, and restaurantsGreat for encouraging kids to develop their washing habits a routine. HOW TO OPERATE IT Install 3 new AA batteries in the behind compartment.Unlock the top cover of the soap cabinet by twisting it anti-clockwise.Pour liquid soap or disinfectant into the dispenser, hold the top cover tightly.Press the power \"+\" button for 2 seconds to switch on.Now you can enjoy it by putting your hand under the sensor. IMPORTANT NOTE ABOUT THE LIQUID SOAP Please dilute the hand sanitizer in a ratio of 1:3,1:4 or 1:5 hand sanitizer and water, then pour it into the water tank. Otherwise, it won't create the foaming experience. SPECIFICATIONS Material: Plastic ABS / PC Capacity : 240ml. Package Dimensions: 8.8 x 5 x 4.1 inches. Weight: 13 ounces. Power Supply: 3 x AA Alkaline Battery (not included) Packaging content: 1 x automatic soap dispenser 1 x instruction manual. SAFETY INSTRUCTIONS Do not immerse the dispenser in water, as it will short circuit.Do not block the foam outlet by hand.Please keep the infra-red motion sensors clear! Avoid direct sunlight to the infrared panel. SATISFACTION GUARANTEE Your satisfaction with our products is our main pursuit, please feel confident to contact us and we will ensure an answer in 24 hrs. Just scroll up and click on add cart and see for yourself.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51BjfKuDUFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CookPal","source_asin":"B08CGRCHL8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-968461","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08CGRCHL8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08CGRCHL8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
