window.products.push({"id":968495,"name":"ComfyDown 95% Feather 5% Down, 14 X 28 Rectangle Decorative Pillow Insert, Sham Stuffer - Made in USA","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51BuNw7eXGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MATERIAL: Expertly filled with 95% feather, 5% down, covered with a top quality, 233 thread count fabric. made of 100% Cotton, with downproof stitching, to prevent feathers from poking out. MADE IN THE USA: Every product in the ComfyDown catalog, is proudly made right here in the United States. Thank you for supporting American manufacturing! You will love the difference! HOW TO MEASURE: Pull tight along the outer seams of your sham, then measure the middle of your sham, from seam to seam - height and width - to find the correct insert needed. RECOMMENDATION: For best results, your pillow insert should be larger than your sham to correctly fill the corners of the pillow cover, this will provide a very attractive firm and fluffy look to your sham, we recommend to place our inserts in shams that are 1\" or 2\" smaller than the pillow, It would depend on the thickness of the sham, a thick fabric would need a 2\" larger insert to keep it fluffed, a more lighter fabric would need a 1\" lager insert. USAGE AND CARE: For indoor use, with all types of shams & covers, before first use, and as needed, fluff up your pillow a few times, to get it a full plump look, this will help it last for years!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51BuNw7eXGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ComfyDown","source_asin":"B0150IDWJ2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-968495","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0150IDWJ2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0150IDWJ2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":968496,"name":"40th Birthday Decorations for The Best 40th Birthday Party - Includes Happy Birthday Banner, Large Number 40 Birthday Latex Balloons + 24 Balloons in ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81B1WXtNBaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A great 40th birthday celebration requires great party decorations. Get this party pack where everything is included and everything is very easy to set up. Click that \" Add to Cart \" button now! WHY SHOULD I BUY THIS? Well first off, it has been scientifically proven (or at least rumored) that this set of 40th birthday decor is creating the perfect setting for the big day.Here’s the deal...Turning 40 only happens once. So make sure to make the day memorable. By choosing this 40th birthday party pack you have everything you need in order to amaze everybody at the party. A LITTLE WARNING… These 40th birthday accessories will add the perfect setting for your party.You are going to receive a lot of positive comments about the decorations.And your party is sure to be remembered for a long time.Now your next question is perhaps… CAN THE BALLOONS BE FILLED WITH AIR OR HELIUM? All of our balloons can be filled with both air or helium. You choose. If you wish to fill the numbers and the balloon stars with air, simply insert the included straw (gently) into the plastic valve at the bottom of the letter and slowly blow to inflate. When the balloon is sufficiently inflated, pull out the straw and pinch the self-sealing plastic valve. The balloons will stay inflated for days. WHAT DOES IT TAKE TO SET UP THE DECORATIONS? Our decorations are very easy to set up however you want.You can set up the balloons in multiple ways:- Hanging from the ceiling in an attached string- Attached to a wall using some tape- Floating using helium and a string attached to the floor- Fill the small balloons with helium and let them float to the ceilingWe sincerely hope our 40th birthday set will make a fantastic addition to your amazing day.So go ahead...Click that \" Add to Cart \" button now.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81B1WXtNBaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Invitian","source_asin":"B07653N6D2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-968496","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07653N6D2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07653N6D2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
