window.products.push({"id":968509,"name":"YuHeGuoJi King Size Fitted Sheet 100% Egyptian Cotton Orange Bed Bottom Sheet 1 Piece Only Premium Hotel Collection Solid Color Bed Fitted Sheet Deep ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61x045gFPzL._AC_SL1400_.jpg","description":"【Dimension】King size fitted sheet measures 78 x 80 inches with a deep pocket fits mattress up to 15 inches deep (1 fitted sheet only). If you need matching egyptian cotton flat sheet, please search for B09DRZ59P8. If you need matching solid orange pillow shams, please search for B09DSRTJCL. 【Material】Made from 100% Egyptian cotton, using professional process, making it super soft, smooth and silky. It features breathable, comfortable, moisture absorbing, durable and easy care. High color fastness, fade resistant. Selected cotton fabric allows you to enjoy a comfy and relaxed sleeping experience every night. This premium Egyptian cotton bedding is suitable for use throughout the year. It is a great choice to choose a set of superior quality bedding for your family and friends. 【15 Inch Deep Pocket】Our fitted sheet is suitable for mattresses up to 15 inches deep. It provides a luxurious, silky touch feel and a tidy and elegant appearance. Premium Egyptian cotton provides maximum care for your skin and relaxes your tired body. Choosing the good bedding is also the beginning of a good sleep. There are a variety of colors to choose from, to maximize the match with your bedroom decoration. 【All-around Elastic】We use thick and widened premium rubber bands, which have superior elastic performance, convenient and firm fixation, and are not easy to deform. The high-elastic rubber bands are wrapped around the bed sheet, which can effectively prevent the bed sheet from shifting and make it easy care. It also prevents the mattress from getting dirty. You can sleep as you want, and the sheet will still be tidy when you wake up. 【Wash Instructions】Recommend hand or machine wash in cold water, gentle cycle. Do not dry clean. Do not bleach. Tumble dry on low heat. Cool iron if needed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61x045gFPzL._AC_SL1400_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YuHeGuoJi","source_asin":"B09DSRP1M9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-968509","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09DSRP1M9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09DSRP1M9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
