window.products.push({"id":968519,"name":"Earth Drinkware SKINNY TUMBLERS (4 pack) - Matte Pastel Colored Acrylic Tumblers with Lids and Straws | 22oz Double Wall Reusable Plastic Tumblers w S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715QMOlGZlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"NEW SIZE 22OZ!!! HAVE IT COLD OR NOT AT ALL - The Earth double wall tumblers keeps cold drinks cold, and warm drinks warm! Who likes that refreshing ice-cold drink to get warm? That’s why your set of 4 tumblers keeps the temperature at a perfect level with its insulated double-walled body. It provides a condensation-free touch and is paired with reusable and durable polypropylene (PP) straw with a ring stopper. 4 PASTEL COLOR TUMBLERS - Set comes with four 22 oz tumblers with color-matching splash-proof lids, reusable plastic straws, and a BONUS straw cleaner. We call them tumblers, but they have as many aliases as they have uses. Water bottles for the sporty. Margarita goblets for the fun. Whatever you call these double-walled acrylic drinking vessels, they’re perfect for parties and amazing keepsakes so everyone can remember how great your party was. So have that party without mixing your cup! WE BELIEVE IN QUALITY - Made with high-grade BPA-free acrylic plastic, this tumbler is the ideal cup for everyday use. Our new, redesigned lid accommodates straw usage as well as easy sipping. An inner seal ring completes the secure, screw-top lid to minimize accidental leakage. While we can’t say a few drops won’t escape, we can say it will save you from cleaning up a giant mess. In addition, we have designed a premium 3-piece set of thank you cards for gifting to someone you love. SOFT MATTE TEXTURE & DIY BLANK - The new satisfying soft touch rubber matte finish tumblers work great with vinyl decals. That’s because you can customize these super cute tumblers with whatever text you’d like! So remind everyone who attended the party, and might not remember all the details, just how great of a weekend it was. The vinyl is so easy to work with, you’ll be wanting to slap cute labels on everything else in your life. The only question? Which 3 friends will make the cut? CLEANING & SIZE - Handwash recommended for cleaning. Straw brush keeps straws free from mold and bacteria. Each tumbler is 9.2” high with a 2.8” diameter and holds 22oz of your favorite beverage. Skinny cup base designed to fit into standard cup holder sizes, making it the perfect drinkware on-the-go.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715QMOlGZlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Earth Drinkware","source_asin":"B0B8BX5K4G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-968519","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B8BX5K4G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B8BX5K4G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
