window.products.push({"id":968570,"name":"Electric Mini Garlic Chopper, Food Slicer and Chopper, Portable Garlic Blender Mini Chopper Food Processor for Pepper Chili Vegetable Nuts Meat (Big 2","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71H9mEvHQbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✔【Super Electric Food Chopper】 package come with 1*motor head, 1*250ML cup,1*100ML cup, 2*blades, 1*handy brush,1* USB cable, 1* user manual.This mini electric garlic chopper made mincing garlic so easy and fast.this 8.5oz food chopper is perfect for small jobs, electric garlic chopper can handle garlic, ginger, peppers, carrots, vegetables, onions, nuts and more,in 5 seconds, Absolutely!This electric garlic chopper will become a kind of kitchen appliance you often use. ✔【Easy to Use and Clean】The chopper fits in the palm of your hand and is one touch activated. One touch button to switch the chopper on or off , just fill the container with your ingredients, lock the cover, you can get an evenly shred food in a few seconds. The whole body of the crusher is waterproof and the blades are removable. You can directly rinse the food chopper after use, which is easy cleaning with no residue. ✔【Time-saving and Simple】People who usually like a lot of garlic, it’s time consuming and your fingers always smell like garlic. After using the mini electric garlic beater, you will get twice as much garlic I would normally get in half the time. Mini electric garlic chopper doesn't take up much room in your kitchen cabinet.If you needed something for chopping that was quick and easy and this chopper is exactly that. ✔【Portable USB Rechargeable】This 8.5oz food processor is taking advantage of compact volume, portable, space-saving, and handle the small needs in your life, and it is a great option when you travel or on camping trips. Actually this is a great device to take on vacation's where the condo doesn't have a fancy food processor. This food cutter support USB rechargeable and it can be used about 35 times after fully charged. ✔【Tips for use】This Mini chopper fitted with a 30W motor designed to drive 3 stainless steel reinforced blades that provide great performance for reliable results.It is recommended that you cut large pieces of food into small pieces before use. Don't pile up the bottom space. For vegetables/fruits with hard skin, peel it off first. For hard roots such as carrots, beetroots, celeries, etc. make sure to preboil or microwave them quickly first before chopping them using the chopper.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71H9mEvHQbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PORKOU","source_asin":"B08NV4X4KV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-968570","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08NV4X4KV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08NV4X4KV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
