window.products.push({"id":968812,"name":"JBHO Hand Blown Italian Style Crystal Bordeaux Wine Glasses - Great Gift Packaging - Red Wine Glasses Lead-Free Premium Crystal Clear Glass - Set of 2","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iQ2KJ8WsS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Classic Bordeaux Wine Glass Design Makes Your Wine Taste Better: The Golden Ratio Design allows you effortlessly swirl your wine and let it breathe and release its delicate aromas, while also elegantly guiding the wine into your mouth. The unique shape of the glass helps to balance the tannins in red wine, reducing bitterness and enhancing the wine's rich fruit flavors. Hand-Blown with 100% Lead-Free Crystal Glass: 10+ highly skilled master glassblowers, 25+ intricate steps, each piece is created with care and precision, resulting in unique and beautiful pieces that are truly special. Whether used for special occasions or as everyday glasses, JBHO glassware is a luxurious and practical choice that is sure to impress. Lead-free crystal glass is not only safer for consumers, but it also has less of an impact on the environment during the manufacturing process. Light but Durable Glasses are Essential for Enhancing Your Wine Tasting Experience: Lightweight glassware is easy to grip, reducing vibration during wine tasting and helping to maintain the wine's aroma and flavor. This is particularly beneficial when tasting multiple wines. A sturdy glass ensures long-term use and is less likely to break. You can simply place the glassware in the dishwasher to get clear and sparkling glasses. Strict Sec QC Creates the Excellent Quality of JBHO. Generally speaking, handmade glassware will have some bubbles or some other defects, but JBHO's bubble defect ratio is much lower than other brands because we not only have QC team, we even have a second QC for each wine glass. Minimizing the risk of inconvenience to users and enhancing customer satisfaction, witch is essential for maintaining JBHO's reputation. Gift Packaging with a 365-day after-sales service: They are packaged in a gift box with high-quality pearl cotton wrapped, ensuring safe transportation. This makes it a perfect gift for Valentine's Day, Mother's Day or any special occasion. Your loved ones will be impressed and ready to enjoy their favorite red and white wines such as Cabernet and Pinot Noir. The modern wine glasses come with a 365-day guarantee from the date of purchase, and you can contact us at any time to resolve issues.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iQ2KJ8WsS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JBHO","source_asin":"B0BWPX5BQH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-968812","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BWPX5BQH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BWPX5BQH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
